  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Acting on Chun Yuqiao's signed instructions, floor director Lin Jie marches the Studio One crew into Unit Two's studio to take charge of Star Night preparations. Listen to the Mandarin dialogue first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "大家都放下手里的活，所有人集合。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "设备一人盯一台。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "放心吧，我都明白。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "现场都先别拍了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "你们干吗呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "制作一部奉命接管演播室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "这跟你们一部都没关系。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "到饭点了，兄弟们把饭送这儿来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "你们居然在这儿吃饭吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "没事，大家先一起吃饱吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "大家都放下手里的活，所有人集合。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone put down what you are doing and gather round.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "设备一人盯一台。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Assign one person to watch each piece of equipment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "放心吧，我都明白。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Rest assured, I understand completely.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "现场都先别拍了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop filming on set for now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "你们干吗呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you doing here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "制作一部奉命接管演播室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Production Unit One is under orders to take over the studio.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "这跟你们一部都没关系。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This studio has nothing to do with Unit One.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "到饭点了，兄弟们把饭送这儿来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is lunchtime; bring the meal boxes over here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "你们居然在这儿吃饭吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you really eating right here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "没事，大家先一起吃饱吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is fine; everyone eat up together first.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "大家都放下手里的活，所有人集合。",
      "gap": 0.5
